      <h1>Building an open-source AI media studio with App Composer</h1>
      <p class="deck">I described a studio I wanted to own. Get Ready checked the machine, Init wrote a specification I could read, and my agent built and deployed it as its own Cloudflare application. This is what it does, how it is put together, what it cost, and the change I made to it afterwards.</p>
